#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central2
msgid ""
"After a bit of examination you notice something engraved on the statue's base. Strange symbols unlike any you have seen before.\n"
"\n"
"Straight and cluttered lines. They don't look like any of the symbols you know. Next to them is an odd pictogram\n"
"\n"
